    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 2145,
      "init": {
        "label": "Planners",
        "body": "# Two planners\n\n**Group Cost Settle** reads a ledger cube (who paid, for whom) and answers who owes whom, as transfers the Sankey draws and as net positions.\n\n**Payoff Planner** takes a debt list and an extra monthly amount, pays every minimum and throws the extra at the head debt; as each clears, its minimum joins the pile. Avalanche (highest APR first) pays the least interest; snowball (smallest balance first) clears a debt sooner. Same money, two orders: compare the two plans."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-ledger",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2657,
      "init": {
        "label": "Expenses (ledger)",
        "cubeText": "[\n  {\"Item\": \"Cabin\",        \"Amount\": 600, \"Paid by\": \"Ada\",          \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\", \"Eve\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Flights\",      \"Amount\": 500, \"Paid by\": \"Bo\",           \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\", \"Eve\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Rental car\",   \"Amount\": 300, \"Paid by\": \"Cy\",           \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\", \"Eve\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Groceries\",    \"Amount\": 150, \"Paid by\": \"Di\",           \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\", \"Eve\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Dinner out\",   \"Amount\": 200, \"Paid by\": \"Eve\",          \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\", \"Eve\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Kayaks\",       \"Amount\": 90,  \"Paid by\": [\"Ada\", \"Di\"], \"For\": [\"Bo\", \"Cy\", \"Di\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Coffee\",       \"Amount\": 40,  \"Paid by\": \"Cy\",           \"For\": [\"Ada\", \"Cy\"]},\n  {\"Item\": \"Eve's ticket\", \"Amount\": 60,  \"Paid by\": \"Bo\",           \"For\": [\"Eve\"]}\n]"
      }
